<view class="page">
  <view wx:if="{{copying}}" class="notice"
    >正在另存为私人菜谱，原始示例配方会保留。</view
  >
  <view class="card form-card">
    <t-input
      label="菜名"
      value="{{name}}"
      maxlength="60"
      placeholder="例如：妈妈的红烧肉"
      data-field="name"
      bind:change="field"
    />
    <picker
      range="{{categories}}"
      value="{{categoryIndex}}"
      bindchange="category"
      ><view class="picker-field"
        ><text>分类</text><text>{{categories[categoryIndex]}} ›</text></view
      ></picker
    >
    <t-input
      label="制作时间（分钟）"
      type="number"
      value="{{minutes}}"
      data-field="minutes"
      bind:change="field"
    />
    <t-input
      label="基础人数"
      type="number"
      value="{{servings}}"
      data-field="servings"
      bind:change="field"
    />
  </view>
  <view class="heading"
    ><text class="section-title">食材与用量</text
    ><text class="caption">请按可食部分填写</text></view
  >
  <view class="notice"
    >旧数据的个、颗、毫升等不是克。切换为克重会清空旧数量，请称重后填写；只有千克和克可直接换算。</view
  >
  <view wx:for="{{ingredients}}" wx:key="rowKey" class="card ingredient-form">
    <view class="ingredient-heading"
      ><text class="caption">食材 {{index + 1}}</text
      ><t-button
        size="small"
        variant="text"
        theme="danger"
        disabled="{{ingredients.length === 1}}"
        data-index="{{index}}"
        bind:tap="removeIngredient"
        >移除</t-button
      ></view
    >
    <t-input
      label="名称"
      value="{{item.name}}"
      maxlength="40"
      data-index="{{index}}"
      data-field="name"
      bind:change="ingredient"
    />
    <t-input
      label="用量"
      type="digit"
      value="{{item.amount}}"
      data-index="{{index}}"
      data-field="amount"
      bind:change="ingredient"
    />
    <picker
      range="{{item.unitOptions}}"
      data-index="{{index}}"
      bindchange="unit"
      ><view class="picker-field"
        ><text>单位</text><text>{{item.unit}} ›</text></view
      ></picker
    >
    <view wx:if="{{item.sourceMeasure}}" class="original-measure"
      >原记录：{{item.sourceMeasure.amount}} {{item.sourceMeasure.unit}}</view
    >
    <view wx:if="{{item.needsReview}}" class="original-measure"
      >按原单位保留，尚待称重核对。</view
    >
    <t-checkbox
      wx:if="{{item.reviewRequired}}"
      checked="{{item.weightConfirmed}}"
      label="我已称重并核对该食材的重量"
      data-index="{{index}}"
      bind:change="confirmWeight"
    />
  </view>
  <t-button
    theme="primary"
    variant="outline"
    block
    icon="add"
    bind:tap="addIngredient"
    >添加食材</t-button
  >
  <view class="card padded steps-form"
    ><text class="section-title">详细做法</text
    ><text class="caption">每行一个步骤，最多40步，每步1000字。</text
    ><t-textarea
      value="{{stepsText}}"
      maxlength="40000"
      placeholder="食材洗净切好…&#10;热锅下油…"
      data-field="stepsText"
      bind:change="field"
      autosize
  /></view>
  <view wx:if="{{error}}" class="warning">{{error}}</view>
  <t-button theme="primary" block disabled="{{!ready}}" bind:tap="save"
    >保存私人菜谱</t-button
  >
  <text class="page-note"
    >保存后会重新计算菜单用量，并取消采购勾选。数据仅存本机。</text
  >
</view>
